direction: down

Roofline Model: {
  direction: right
  MB: Memory Bound 区域\n性能 = BW × AI\n（斜线，随 AI 线性增长）
  RP: Ridge Point\nAI = Peak / BW
  CB: Compute Bound 区域\n性能 = Peak Compute\n（水平线，不再增长）
  
  MB -> RP
  RP -> CB
  
  MB.style.stroke: orange
  RP.style.stroke: blue
  CB.style.stroke: green
  CB.style.bold: true
}

Low: 低 AI 操作\nLayerNorm, Softmax\nEmbedding Lookup
High: 高 AI 操作\n大 GEMM, Conv

Low -> Roofline Model.MB
High -> Roofline Model.CB

Low.style.stroke: red
High.style.stroke: green
